WEBVTT

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:32.077
AG: How much of the burnout experience
was a sense of guilt?

00:09:32.101 --> 00:09:34.976
Like you were letting these students down.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:38.196
CC: Yeah, I think
that's at the heart of it, for sure.

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:43.476
We call it Catholic guilt
in my family, but yes. (Laughs)

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:45.706
I mean, how can you sit there

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:52.166
and watch kids who have
so much potential just flounder?

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:55.506
That just feels
like such an immense failure.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:58.476
AG: So what did Conrey
do to overcome burnout?

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:00.786
She worked more.